            {
              "content": "=Extract booking details from this customer message. Do NOT infer or calculate any date that is not explicitly stated as a specific date in the message. If a date is relative (e.g. 'next Friday', 'in two weeks') and not given as an explicit date, return null for that field. Every date should be in the format YYYY-MM-DD. Message: {{ $json.body.message }}"
