              "content": "=You are drafting a reply to a customer flight booking inquiry.\n\nCustomer's extracted request:\n{{ JSON.stringify($node[\"Ensure Json Format\"].json) }}\n\nMatching booking record:\n{{ JSON.stringify($node[\"DB Query for Booking\"].json) }}\n\nClassified intent: {{ $node[\"Urgency & Intent\"].json.intent }}\nClassified urgency: {{ $node[\"Urgency & Intent\"].json.urgency }}\n\nWrite a short, professional reply (3-5 sentences) confirming or addressing the requested change based on the booking record above. Do not invent information not present in the booking record. If the requested_change cannot be fulfilled from the record, say so politely and note it will be reviewed.\n\nOutput plain text only, no JSON, no markdown."
            }
