              "content": "=Classify this customer service message. Intent must be one of: date_change, cancellation, inquiry, complaint, other. Urgency must be one of: low, medium, high — base urgency on tone, stated deadlines, or words like 'urgent', 'asap', 'emergency'. Message: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.message }}"
